@startuml OctoTify_Sequence_RecordStatus

skinparam sequenceStyle svg
skinparam linetype ortho

title 更新推送状态（通用）

participant "MessageService" as Service
participant "MessageRepo" as Repo
database "SQLite" as DB

note over Service: 推送完成后更新消息状态\n100（待推送）→ 200（成功）/ 300（失败）\n或重试场景：300 → 100 → 200/300

== 更新状态 ==

Service -> Repo: updateMessageStatus(messageId, status)
activate Repo

alt 数据库更新失败
    Repo -> DB: UPDATE messages SET status = ?, updated_at = ? WHERE id = ?
    activate DB
    DB --> Repo: 更新失败
    deactivate DB
    Repo --> Service: ErrMessageRecordFailed (110704)
    deactivate Repo
    Service -> Service: 记录状态更新失败日志
else 数据库更新成功
    Repo -> DB: UPDATE messages SET status = ?, updated_at = ? WHERE id = ?
    activate DB
    DB --> Repo: 成功
    deactivate DB
    Repo --> Service: 成功
    deactivate Repo
end

@enduml